      "sourceTextSha256": "870bb306864415293c6cae522f40f39eb40488df8978bfa0c2b3a8f3062c3a0b",
      "text": "\n\n## What to expect\n\nOn your first day, you head straight from the airport area to Poás Volcano and La Paz. The altitude, temperature and vegetation change along the way, and you pass coffee plantations, ferns, and farms growing flowers and strawberries.\n\nThe next three days take you through northern Costa Rica. From the Arenal area, travel along the Frío River to the Caño Negro reserve, follow trails to the turquoise waters of the Río Celeste, and walk across the Mistico hanging bridges.\n\nAfter exploring these natural areas, you transfer to Tamarindo Beach, where you have two free days.\n",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-6mzdtygns6d-mw6m967j",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      }
